Package: buzzard-torrent-search
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Open Research Tools <maintainers@openresearchtools.org>
Depends: ca-certificates
Description: reusable public torrent-search service for Buzzard applications
 Provides the pinned Jackett Mini public-source runtime, JSON CLI and stdio
 MCP interface for Wild Buzzard, Buzzard Agent and other local applications.
